  <Docs>
    <summary>Defines the behavior when the two numbers in the range are identical after rounding.</summary>
    <remarks>
      <para>Defines the behavior when the two numbers in the range are identical after rounding. To programmatically detect
            when the identity fallback is used, compare the lower and upper BigDecimals via FormattedNumber.</para>
